      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier today and my lower back just went crazy. it felt like a sharp snap and now i have this weird shooting pain that goes all the way down my right leg. also my foot feels kinda heavy/weak when i walk? i think i just pulled something. do u think i should try some really deep stretches or maybe try to crack my back to get it back in place? i dont wanna go to the doctor if i dont have to.",
